{
  "uid": "ecommerce-apm",
  "title": "电商 APM · RED 与 Go Runtime",
  "id": null,
  "version": 3,
  "schemaVersion": 42,
  "editable": true,
  "description": "ecommerce 服务的 RED 与 Go runtime；RPC 与 GC pause 的真实埋点边界在面板内明示。",
  "tags": [
    "infrastructure",
    "alerting",
    "evidence"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "怎么读这张 APM 面板",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**服务下拉只选 ecommerce 服务**（10 个 Go 服务）。RED 第一组用 `http_server_request_duration_seconds_*`——这是 ecommerce 目前真正上报的服务端埋点。\n\n`rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_*` 与 `rpc_response_status_code`（OK / UNAVAILABLE 等大写值）当前只在 **config-center** 的 config-service 上出现，所以第二组 RED 单独提供 RPC 服务下拉；两个下拉互不替代，某组没有埋点就显示「指标缺失」，**不画成 0 错误率**。\n\nlabels 在 VM 里是下划线形式（`service_name` / `service_namespace`），OTel 语义名中的点号已被 `usePrometheusNaming` 改掉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "HTTP 请求速率",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_namespace=\"ecommerce\",service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "指标缺失",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "指标缺失",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
